# The football lady (workstream CUCOS, Nov 3 2026; design/godot-cucos.md). 1995.
# Every line she says and every response is Steven's, as he wrote it. The stage direction "she looks
# confused" is the gesture `act("thinking")` (the rig has no "confused" clip). She has no speaker name:
# Steven didn't give one.
#
# Flags (mall.flags, saved): cu_lady_mad (answered "what a win": mad for good), cu_lady_cold (doesn't
# watch football: cold for good), cu_lady_cold_n (which of her two cold lines is next),
# cu_coupon_given (the coupon is handed over once only).

~ start
if cu_lady_mad
	I'm still mad about the game.
	=> END
if cu_lady_cold
	if cu_lady_cold_n == 1
		set cu_lady_cold_n = 0
		I don't want to talk to you.
	else
		set cu_lady_cold_n = 1
		Well, what are we supposed to talk about if you don't watch football?
	=> END
Oh, hey, did you watch the game last night?
- Sure did. Wow, what a win.
	set cu_lady_mad = true
	Is that supposed to be some kind of a joke or something? You clearly didn't watch the game, or at least the end of it, when we lost in overtime. Makes me mad just thinking about it.
	=> END
- Yeah, I did. Tough loss, but we'll get 'em next time.
	=> rest_of_day
- No, I don't watch football.
	set cu_lady_cold = true
	set cu_lady_cold_n = 0
	$> act("thinking")
	Don't watch sports? Well, what else is there to life than family, country and football? I don't understand you.
	=> END

~ rest_of_day
I know, right? Breaks my heart when we lose in overtime like that. But we'll get 'em next time. What are you doing for the rest of the day?
- Watching another football game, of course.
	=> where
- Go see a movie, because the last thing I want to do is think about football again.
	Well, have fun with that. Who dat?
	=> END
- Just hang out at the mall, I guess.
	Well, have fun with that. Who dat?
	=> END

~ where
Ain't that the truth? Another chance for our team to let us down. AGAIN. Ha ha ha ha ha. Where are you watching the game?
- At my house, on my couch with my wife and a beer.
	Well, have fun. Let's get that W. Who dat?
	=> END
- My podnas are watching the game on the east side, so I'm going there.
	Well, have fun. Let's get that W. Who dat?
	=> END
- I think I'm going to watch it at Cuco's, but I haven't decided yet.
	if cu_coupon_given
		PLACEHOLDER (she already gave you the coupon; Steven to write what she says the second time)
		=> END
	Hey, well, you're in Cuco's, huh? Well, you're actually in luck. I have a coupon for a free top-shelf margarita at Cuco's. They normally charge $10 for it. It's free.
	set cu_coupon_given = true
	give cu_coupon
	=> END
